Q: Add available new AI model for my API key to use in Claude Code A: <p>you can use /model in chat to select the available models or you can visit to C drive/users/.claude/setting.json/open and add the available model with correct syntax. which is</p>
<pre><code>{
  &quot;env&quot;: {
    &quot;ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL&quot;: &quot;https://link of the provider,
    &quot;ANTHROPIC_API_KEY&quot;: &quot;Your provider API KEY&quot;,
    &quot;ANTHROPIC_MODEL&quot;: &quot;claude-opus-4-6&quot;
  },
  &quot;model&quot;: &quot;claude-opus-4-6&quot;
}
</code></pre>
